SUMMARY:Woodside Square Community Environment Day
DESCRIPTION:Join Councillor Myers (Ward 23) and the City of Toronto to help
  reduce the amount of waste going to landfill. Drop off household items fo
 r donation\, electronics for reuse or recycling and household hazardous wa
 ste for proper disposal.\n\nPick up free bagged compost while supplies las
 t and kitchen catchers for organics ($7 each – cash\, debit and credit a
 ccepted).\n\nMore Information\nWebsite: www.toronto.ca
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://gnntoronto.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/04
 /Event_Featured-Image_Community-Environment-Day-at-Woodside-Square.jpg
CATEGORIES:City of Toronto
LOCATION:Woodside Square\, 1571 Sandhurst Cir\, Scarborough\, Toronto\, M1S
  5J9\, ON\, Canada
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=1571 Sandhurst Cir\, Scarbo
 rough\, Toronto\, M1S 5J9\, ON\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Woodsid
 e Square:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Green Neighbours Network of Toronto
UID:14@gnntoronto.ca
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20250503T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20250503T140000
DTSTAMP:20250416T173610Z
URL:https://gnntoronto.ca/events/beach-united-ecofair/
SUMMARY:Beach United EcoFair
DESCRIPTION:This year’s EcoFair at Beach United will be on Saturday\, Ma
 y 3rd\, 2025 from 10am-2pm. Get inspired\, get involved\, and bring the en
 tire family. There will be food\, vendors\, and exhibitors – bring somet
 hing in to our Repair Café\, or your bike for a free tune-up!\nIf you ar
 e still interested in being a vendor or non-profit exhibitor\, please fill
  out our online application form. If you are interested in volunteering t
 he day of\, please fill out this form.\nAnd if you are curious as to why 
 a church might be interested in environmental issues\, please take a look 
 at this blog post. For photos and videos of previous Ecofair events\, see
  below.\nEcofair 2024 photo album on Facebook\nEcofair 2023 photo album 
 on Facebook
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://gnntoronto.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/04
 /Event_Featured-Image_Beach-United-Church.jpg
CATEGORIES:Member Group
END:VEVENT
