URL:https://gnntoronto.ca/events/cedarvale-park-tree-planting-event/
SUMMARY:Cedarvale Park Tree Planting Event
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we increase local biodiversity and create valuable w
 ildlife habitat by planting native trees and shrubs at Cedarvale Park!\nEv
 ent site conditions vary. Contact us for more information including access
 ibility. If you would like to request accessibility support\, contact us a
 s soon as possible.\n\nGroup registration for this event is full. Individu
 als and groups of four or fewer people may still attend.\n\n\n\nMore Infor
 mation\nWebsite: www.toronto.ca\nEmail: greentoronto@toronto.ca
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://gnntoronto.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/04
 /Event_Featured-Image_Cedarvale-Park-Tree-Planting-Event.jpg
