SUMMARY:Plastic Pellet Blitz: A Community Science Event
DESCRIPTION:Join the University of Toronto (U of T) Trash Team in celebra
 ting the Provincial Day of Action on Litter\, with our plastic pellet bli
 tz! This community science cleanup focuses on a less familiar source of mi
 croplastic pollution known as pre-production plastic pellets (or nurdles)!
   Register in advance and get more details at: https://www.eventbrite.ca
 /e/plastic-pellet-blitz-a-community-science-event-tickets-1308813469319?af
 f=oddtdtcreator\n\nAll supplies will be provided. Please dress for the wea
 ther. Pizza and light refreshments will be provided. Bottle-filling statio
 ns are available at the park\, so remember to bring your reusable water bo
 ttle.
