URL:https://gnntoronto.ca/events/cnib-gta-hub-repair-cafe/
SUMMARY:CNIB GTA Hub Repair Café
DESCRIPTION:The Repair Café at the CNIB GTA Community Hub runs from 11 AM 
 to 2 PM. The primary focus of this event is on repairing accessibility dev
 ices such as Perkins braillers\, white canes\, electronic magnifiers\, tal
 king and braille watches\, and sewing-related repairs. The Repair Café do
 es not charge for repairs\, it is free! We encourage individuals to RSVP i
 n advance to secure priority for repairs\, although walk-ins are also welc
 ome. While the event primarily serves the blind and visually impaired comm
 unity\, we may accommodate individuals outside of this community based on 
 availability and foot traffic. The Repair Café at the CNIB Community Hub 
 is usually held on the third Saturday of every second month\, or the secon
 d Saturday if conflicting with other events For further details or inquiri
 es\, please feel free to contact Wendy Hoang at wendy.hoang@cnib.ca.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://gnntoronto.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/04
 /Event_Featured-Image_Repair-Cafe.jpg
