SUMMARY:The Ripple Effects of Draining Ontario’s Wetlands - Environmental
  Defence
DESCRIPTION:Now\, more than ever\, we need wetlands champions. Join us tole
 arn more about wetland losses and wetlands protection on a local\, regiona
 land provincial level. Together\, we can confront environmental threats an
 d wetlandlosses\, demand the Ontario government reverse course\, and explo
 re how tochampion wetland protection.\n\nFor more information and to regis
 ter\, go to: https://act.environmentaldefence.ca/page/169440/petition/1?e
 a.tracking.id=eblast&amp\;ea.url.id=8077261&amp\;forwarded=true
