SUMMARY:Karma Food Co-op Annual Plant Swap
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin Karma's seed librarian Jen Knoch for our Co-op's annual 
 plant swap. Trade seedlings\, cuttings\, and houseplants.\n\n\n\nHappening
  right outside Karma Co-op (739 Palmerston Ave. - Inside Karma Lane).\n\n\
 n\nWhile it's a pain\, anything divided from an existing garden should hav
 e its roots washed and be repotted in store-bought soil to prevent the pos
 sible spread of invasive jumping worms.\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://gnntoronto.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/05
 /Karma-Food-Co-op-Plant-Swap.jpg
CATEGORIES:Other
LOCATION:https://www.karmacoop.org/contact#map
END:VEVENT
