SUMMARY:Bermondsey Drop-Off Depot Community Environment Day
DESCRIPTION:Help reduce the amount of waste going to landfill. Drop off hou
 sehold items for donation\, electronics for reuse or recycling and househo
 ld hazardous waste for proper disposal. Pick up free bagged compost while 
 supplies last and kitchen catchers for organics ($7 each – cash\, debit 
 and credit accepted).\n\nAt Drop-Off Depot events\, a safe motorized vehic
 le is required to drop off waste for disposal and all loads must be proper
 ly secured. Walk-ins\, bicycles and manual transportation devices are not 
 permitted. Any unsafe vehicles or unsecured loads will be refused entry.\n
 \nMore Information\nWebsite: www.toronto.ca
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://gnntoronto.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/04
