URL:https://gnntoronto.ca/events/taylor-massey-creek-clean-up/
SUMMARY:Taylor Massey Creek Clean Up
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we come together to clean a one-kilometre stretch of
  the Taylor Massey Creek — from the culvert near Miniot Circle to Foxrid
 ge\, and back.\n\n\nAll supplies provided. Just bring your energy and comm
 unity spirit!\n\n\nAnd don’t miss the potluck BBQ after the cleanup — 
 plus special guest speakers to help us celebrate 30 years of environmental
  impact.\n\n\nBe a part of the longest-running neighbourhood cleanup in To
 ronto!\n\n\nWhether it’s your first time or your 30th\, your helping han
 ds make a big difference.\nSave the date. Spread the word. Let’s do this
  together.\n\n\nFarlinger Ravine Trail\, Scarborough. Meet at the bridge b
 ehind the Dollarama (Kennedy Park Plaza)\n\n\n
