DESCRIPTION:Come out and help remove invasive Buckthorn with DMWTD and Toro
 nto Nature Stewards. Each year we have a great group of folks helping to r
 estore a large area in Sunnybrook Park. We will be removing Buckthorn and 
 also DSV\, Honeysuckle etc.  We provide everything\, including intruction
 s and snacks.
