DESCRIPTION:Pape 172 buses only in June\, July\, Aug\, Sept. Otherwise It
 ’s a 25 min walk down Cherry St then east along bike path\, or\, a 35 mi
 n walk down Leslie Street and west along bike path.\n\nKnown as the cleane
 st beach in Toronto\, many people sunbathe\, swim\, paddle and sail here! 
 The stewardship site meets at northwest corner of Regatta Road and the Mar
 tin Goodman Trail.\n\nTickets: Free\n\nMore Info: https://torontonatures
 tewards.org/sites/cherry-beach/
