SUMMARY:Viewmount Park Tree Planting Event
DESCRIPTION:Join us in planting native trees and shrubs at Viewmount Park. 
 Help increase Toronto's urban canopy and biodiversity!\n\n\nFollow signs f
 rom the parking lot to the planting location.\n\nEvent site conditions var
 y. Contact us for more information including accessibility. If you would l
 ike to request accessibility support\, contact us as soon as possible.\n\n
 Group registration for this event is full. Individuals and groups of four 
 or fewer people may still attend.\n\n\nMore Information\nWebsite: www.tor
 onto.ca\nEmail: greentoronto@toronto.ca
