URL:https://gnntoronto.ca/events/toronto-botanical-garden-dawn-chorus-bird
 ing/
SUMMARY:Toronto Botanical Garden - Dawn Chorus Birding
DESCRIPTION:Experience the serene magic of the garden in the early morning 
 calm\, when the air is still and the natural world comes alive with birdso
 ng. Join us for a special birdwatching event as migratory birds pass overh
 ead on their journey south. Guided by Sasan Beni\, TBG’s Seasonal Hortic
 ulturist and passionate birder\, you’ll learn to spot and identify the f
 eathered visitors that grace our skies. Bring your binoculars (or borrow a
  pair from us) and a mug for a warm drink and friendly conversation after 
 the walk.\n\nRegistration: Public $22\, Members $20 (plus applicable taxe
 s and fees)\n\nDetails on accessibility and further information:\n\nhttps:
 //www.eventbrite.ca/e/dawn-chorus-birding-tickets-1089914105429?aff=oddtdt
 creator
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://gnntoronto.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/05
 /Birding-Toronto-Botanical-Garden-2025.jpg
CATEGORIES:Other
END:VEVENT
