URL:https://gnntoronto.ca/events/doors-open-toronto-trcas-administrative-o
 ffice/
SUMMARY:Doors Open Toronto: TRCA's Administrative Office
DESCRIPTION:Toronto and Region Conservation Authority (TRCA) is unveiling a
  brand-new Administrative Office building that brings together cutting-edg
 e sustainability design and practice in one unique structure. Mass timber 
 construction\, an Open Loop Geothermal heating/cooling system and minimal 
 use of concrete combine to create a building with low greenhouse gas emiss
 ions - the estimated CO2 reduction is roughly equivalent to taking more th
 an 240 cars off the road for a year!\n\nJoin us for Doors Open Toronto a
 nd get a chance to explore one of the most sustainable buildings in North 
 America. Discover the innovative green technologies integrated into TRCA's
  new Administrative Office through interactive displays and drop-in guided
  tours happening every 30 minutes. Take part in games\, activities and oth
 er family-friendly learning opportunities to uncover hidden gems of the lo
 cal environment. Each guest will leave inspired to be an environmental cha
 mpion.\n\nTRCA is committed to creating an accessible experience for all p
 articipants. If you require an accessibility accommodation\, or have any q
 uestions about this event\, please email tisha.tan@trca.ca at least 7 da
 ys prior to the event.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://gnntoronto.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/05
 /2025-TRCAadminOffice-May-24-25-2025-resized.jpg
CATEGORIES:Member Group
LOCATION:TRCA's Administrative Office\, 5 Shoreham Drive\, Toronto\, Ontari
 o\, M3N 1S4\, Canada
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=5 Shoreham Drive\, Toronto\
 , Ontario\, M3N 1S4\, Canada;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=TRCA's Administrat
 ive Office:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
